{"slug":"456281-praanigala-picnic","title":"ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳ ಪಿಕ್‌ನಿಕ್‌","titleEn":"Praanigala Picnic","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/456281-praanigala-picnic","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":456281,"authors":["Amar  Goswami"],"illustrators":["Partho Sengupta"],"translators":["Hema Khurshapur"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2022","originalStory":{"title":"सैर सपाटा"},"copyrightNotice":"'Praanigala Picnic' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org","attributionLine":"ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳ ಪಿಕ್‌ನಿಕ್‌ (Kannada), translated by Hema Khurshapur, based on original story सैर सपाटा, written by Amar  Goswami, illustrated by Partho Sengupta, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"A mouse and a rabbit looking over a rock","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":3,"title":"Blindfolded bear looking for his friends","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":4,"title":"A rabbit, a mouse and a squirrel carrying fruits","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":5,"title":"Animals carrying fruits","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":6,"title":"Three animals eating apples with relish","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":7,"title":"A tree stump","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":8,"title":"A monkey and a squirrel","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"},{"page":9,"title":"Animals talking to one other","illustrator":"Partho Sengupta","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2006"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಐವರು ಗೆಳೆಯರಿದ್ದರು-","ಮಂಗ, ಇಲಿ, ಮೊಲ, ಅಳಿಲು, ಕರಡಿ.","ಕಾಡಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದು ಉದ್ಯಾನವಿತ್ತು.","ಒಂದು ದಿನ ಎಲ್ಲರೂ ಪಿಕ್‌ನಿಕ್‌ಗೆ ಹೋಗಿದ್ದರು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p02.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಎಲ್ಲರೂ ಕಣ್ಣಾಮುಚ್ಚಾಲೆ ಆಡಿದರು.","ಕಳ್ಳ-ಪೊಲೀಸ್ ಆಟ ಆಡಿದರು.","ಸಾಕಾಗುವಷ್ಟು ಓಡಾಡಿದರು.","ತುಂಬಾ ಹೊತ್ತು ಆಟ ಆಡಿದರು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p03.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮಂಗ ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಈಗ ಊಟದ ಸಮಯ.","ತಿನ್ನಲು ಏನಾದರೂ ತನ್ನಿ.\"","ಎಲ್ಲರೂ ಬೇಗನೆ ಒಂದೊಂದು ತಂದರು.","ಮೊಲ ಕ್ಯಾರೆಟ್ ತಂದಿತು.","ಇಲಿ ತಂದಿತು ತಾಜಾ ಮೂಲಂಗಿ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p04.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅಳಿಲು ಟೊಮೋಟೊ ತಂದಿತು.","ಮಂಗ ತಂದಿತು ಸೇಬು.","ಕರಡಿ ಎಲೆಕೋಸು ತಂದಿತು.","ಎಲ್ಲಾ ತೊಳೆದು, ಕತ್ತರಿಸಿ, ಸೇರಿಸಿದರು."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಈಗ ತಿನ್ನುವುದು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕರಡಿ ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಅಯ್ಯೋ, ಇದು ವಿಚಿತ್ರವಾಗಿದೆ. ಏನಂತಾರೆ ಇದಕ್ಕೆ.”","ಇಲಿ ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಇದು ಚಾಟ್.”","ಮೊಲ ಎಂದಿತು, “ಬಣ್ಣ ಬಣ್ಣವಾಗಿದೆ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p07.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಅಳಿಲು, “ಎಲ್ಲ ಒಂದರೊಳಗೊಂದು ಸೇರಿದೆ.”","ಕೋತಿ ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಇದಕ್ಕೆ ಸಲಾಡ್ ಎನ್ನುತ್ತಾರೆ.","ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ತಿನ್ನಿ,","ಶಕ್ತಿವಂತರಾಗಿ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/456281-praanigala-picnic/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಇಲಿ ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಇನ್ನು ಮುಂದೆ ನಾನು ಇದನ್ನೇ ತಿನ್ನುತ್ತೇನೆ.","ತಿಂದು, ತಿಂದು ಸಿಂಹದಷ್ಟು ಶಕ್ತಿಶಾಲಿ ಆಗುತ್ತೇನೆ.”","ಎಲ್ಲರೂ ನಗಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿದರು ."]}],"wordCount":105}